OL,3,GNEWSAE-scooter modified for child to
OL,4,Aride seized
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn e-scooter which had been modified to
OL,7,Fallow a four-year-old to ride is one of
OL,8,Fmore than 1,000 seized by Derbyshire
OL,9,FPolice, as the force released new
OL,10,Ffigures this week.
OL,12,FThe model, which was seized and crushed
OL,13,Fby officers based in Allestree in
OL,14,FDerby, had been fitted with a second
OL,15,Fset of mini handlebars to allow a child
OL,16,Fto be a passenger.
OL,18,FThe incident came just a few months
OL,19,Finto a new "seize first" approach by
OL,20,Fthe force towards the illegal vehicles,
OL,21,Fwhich began in November 2024.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
